      "id": "2123631452869046304",
      "text": "Berkly Catton's growth is more evident every game... even in the basic box score results. Catton scored his 7th goal last season in his 62nd game. He now has 7 goals through 18 games and 1+ period this season. Closing in on tying his assist and point totals too. #SEAKraken",
